{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>RawData.Constants</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"elpi","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Elpi","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"API","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"RawData","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Constants","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-declare_global_symbol\"><a href=\"#val-declare_global_symbol\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> declare_global_symbol : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?variant</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-constant\">constant</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A global symbol declared by hand:</p><ul><li>list it in the <code>BuiltIn.MLConstants</code> of an OCaml builtins declaration (<code>BuiltIn.declare</code>)</li><li>be sure the Elpi text of that declaration contains plain <code>symb f : ty</code> (or a <code>pred</code> / <code>func</code> signature), followed by <code>= &quot;variant&quot;</code> if it is not the default variant. The same name and variant give the same constant. Several global symbols can share a name if their variants differ: a variant is the name of the library followed by a dot and a name, e.g. <code>&quot;std.1&quot;</code> or <code>&quot;json.1&quot;</code>, so that two libraries cannot collide. Without <code>variant</code>, the default variant: two libraries that declare the same name share the symbol.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-lookup\"><a href=\"#val-lookup\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> lookup : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../State/index.html#type-t\">State.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-constant\">constant</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>lookup &quot;p&quot; st</code> gives the constant of <code>p</code> in the program that runs.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-show\"><a href=\"#val-show\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> show : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-constant\">constant</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-orc\"><a href=\"#val-orc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> orc : <a href=\"../index.html#type-constant\">constant</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Map\"><a href=\"#module-Map\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Map</span><span> = <a href=\"../../Data/Constants/Map/index.html\">Data.Constants.Map</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Set\"><a href=\"#module-Set\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Set</span><span> : <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Set.S <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">elt</span> = <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">constant</span></span></span></code></div></div>"}